  {
    "code": "octgn:6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf",
    "octgnid": "6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf",
    "name": "The Siege of Annúminas",
    "type_code": "rules",
    "sphere_code": "encounter",
    "traits": "",
    "text": "\"...they were foes of the Dark Lord, but they were overcome by the evil king of Carn Dûm in the Land of Angmar.\" —Tom Bombadil, The Fellowship of the Ring\nRally your heroes for an epic confrontation with the forces of Angmar in The Siege of Annúminas, a unique scenario designed for The Lord of the Rings: The Card Game special event at Gen Con 2016! This scenario can be played in both standard game mode and epic multiplayer mode.\nExpansion Symbol\nThe cards in The Siege of Annúminas scenario can be identified by this symbol before each card's collector number.",
    "is_unique": false,
    "pack_code": "TSoA",
    "pack_name": "The Siege of Annúminas",
    "position": 997,
    "quantity": 0,
    "encounter_set": "The Siege of Annuminas",
    "back_name": "The Siege of Annúminas",
    "back_text": "Scenario Rules\nThe Siege of Annúminas can be played in one of two game modes: standard game mode and epic multiplayer mode. Standard game mode supports 1–4 players and requires only 1 copy of The Siege of Annúminas. Epic multiplayer mode supports 3–12 players and requires 3 copies of The Siege of Annúminas. To play in standard game mode, follow the Setup instructions on the double-sided setup card labeled \"Standard Game Mode.\" To play in epic multiplayer mode, follow the Setup instructions on the double-sided setup card labeled \"Epic Multiplayer Mode.\"\nEpic Multiplayer Mode\nEpic multiplayer mode divides a group of 3–12 players into 3 teams who play at 3 different stages simultaneously. Each stage is its own game and requires its own encounter deck to play. The teams at each stage must work together in order to defeat the scenario.",
    "back_type_code": "rules",
    "back_imagesrc": "/cards/6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf.B.jpg",
    "printed_stats": {},
    "imagesrc": "/cards/6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf.jpg",
    "packs": [
      {
        "pack_code": "TSoA",
        "pack_name": "The Siege of Annúminas",
        "position": 997,
        "quantity": 0,
        "octgnid": "6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf",
        "imagesrc": "https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/6c89f835-68f8-4882-90ea-83f84953fabf.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "source": "dragncards",
    "source_url": "https://dragncards.com/plugin/1",
    "official": true,
    "nightmare": false
  },
