    "encounter_set": "The Siege of Annuminas",
    "back_name": "Standard Game Mode",
    "back_text": "Forced: When the players advance to stage 2A (and before resolving its 'when revealed' effect), shuffle each set aside Dúnedain of Annúminas into the encounter deck. Then, shuffle X copies of Host of Angmar into the encounter deck, where X is one less than the number of players in the game, to a minimum of 1.\nIf a player is eliminated from the game, deal 9 damage to Annúminas.",
